  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training programme on Decision Support Systems for Water Resources Part II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall target of the project is to support the Omani government (MRMWR) to work with the Decision Support System and to introduce the concepts of setting up a National Water Database for all water-related data, which will enable the decision makers to make informed decisions based on available data. This could support Oman in improving their (integrated) water management and using the available water resources to its highest potential.</narrative>
  </description>
